; Shared DEFAULT death burst -- the fallback the director resolves for every character's
; `death` emitter (vfx/character/<id>/ is searched first, so any character can drop its
; own death_default.tscn to override this). Neutral placeholder: a rising smoke puff plus
; pale motes. Tweak per character or replace wholesale.

